DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250414
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250415
SUMMARY:Oklahoma: 514 (partnership) / 512-S (S-corp) due
DESCRIPTION:Oklahoma partnership return due 30 days after the federal partn
 ership due date (federal is March 15\, so OK's date is approximately April 
 14). | Oklahoma partnership return due 30 days after the federal partnershi
 p due date (federal is March 15\, so OK's date is approximately April 14). 
 Automatic if a valid federal extension is filed and no Oklahoma tax is due\
 ; otherwise file Form 504-C/504-PTE with at least 90% of tax paid by the or
 iginal due date. | Authority: Oklahoma Tax Commission\, direct fetch this s
 ession: "Your Oklahoma return is due 30 days after the due date of your fed
 eral return." | Source: https://oklahoma.gov/content/dam/ok/en/tax/document
 s/forms/businesses/corporate-income-tax/current/514-Pkt.pdf | This date is 
 computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced chang
 e\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
